==Description==
'''MJ Hehe''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Hexscape Event#Hexscape Event Battle Pass|Hexscape Event Battle Pass]]. It was obtained at Level 38 of the premium track, which costed {{CandyCorns|1,360 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|206}} ({{Robux|154}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale) to unlock.  It had a total cost of {{CandyCorns|24,220 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|3,422}} ({{Robux|2,567}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale).

==Appearance==
This sticker showcases a person with green skin, likely a zombie, wearing a white, blue and black suit and fedora. The person is performing a moonwalk while also holding its fedora. Voice saying "''Hehe''" can be heard while using this sticker.

==Trivia==
*'''MJ Hehe''' is a reference to [[wp:Michael Jackson|Michael Jackson]] in multiple ways.
**The name and and sound of this sticker is a reference to his famous line, "''hehe''".
**The sticker itself showcases [[wp:Michael Jackson|Michael Jackson]] with green skin performing the [[wp:Moonwalk (dance)|moonwalk]] dance, which was popularized by him.
**The outfit he wears comes from the music video of [[wp:Smooth Criminal|Smooth Criminal]].

